{
  "_comment": [
    "Trusted tool registry (AS-013). This file is authoritative; an MCP server's",
    "self-description is not. A server announcing its own risk levels is untrusted",
    "input - exactly the channel a poisoned server would use to describe its",
    "destructive operation as a harmless read.",
    "",
    "Every entry is enumerated. No wildcards, no patterns, no defaults: a tool that",
    "is not listed here cannot be invoked, and an operation that is not listed for",
    "its tool cannot be invoked either.",
    "",
    "The set of tool.operation pairs here must stay consistent with",
    "policy/agentsec/authz.rego. tests/test_registry.py asserts that."
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
